# Installed npm packages, at any depth. The root tree is materialised by
# `npm install` from package-lock.json, which resolves the required documentation
# toolchain declared in devDependencies (jsdoc, markdownlint-cli2,
# markdown-link-check). The tools/docs-md tree is materialised by `npm run docs:md`
# from tools/docs-md/package-lock.json, which is committed alongside its manifest so
# the optional renderer resolves to the same closure every time. Both trees are
# reproducible from a committed lockfile, so neither is ever committed itself.
node_modules/

# Generated JSDoc output. Written here by `npm run docs:api` and `npm run docs:md`
# from the annotations in server.js. Build product only: the authored documentation
# under docs/ is committed instead, and no authored link ever points in here.
docs/api/generated/
